Don't use a pick-axe to dig through Gehennom.  Use your wands of
digging and then throw them away.  If you run out of them, find some
minotaurs.  Use the wands of light along paths.  Ditch all but 2
striking, and 2 cold; ditch magic missile; stash cold, lightning and
fire but keep 2 fire wands on you for engraving.  Keep a wand of
secret door detection.  Stash/polypile locking, probing.  Create
monster may be useful if you want a cockatrice but otherwise stash
them.
